Track 1: Sun-Dog Reckoning
- Story & Context: In the shadow of the Sector 7 intersection, Mara calibrated her trumpet to the frequency of the flickering signal, ignoring the stinging smell of ozone while the local constable watched, bewildered as her horn literally melted the plastic housing of the nearby kiosk. "Bend the light until the iron screams," she chanted to the gathered crowd, knowing this was the first strike against the city’s silence.
